sequenceDiagram
    participant Chain as Solana
    participant Disc as Discovery
    participant Risk as Risk + AI
    participant Auto as AutoTrader
    participant PM as Position Manager
    participant Mon as Exit Monitors

    Chain->>Disc: new token / pool event
    Disc->>Risk: candidate (deduped, filtered)
    Risk->>Risk: rule-based score + optional AI second opinion
    Risk->>Auto: combined score
    Auto->>PM: open position (per matching SnipeConfig)
    PM->>Chain: Jupiter quote -> sign -> simulate -> send
    Chain-->>PM: on-chain confirmation (real balance delta)
    loop every price tick
        Mon->>PM: evaluate TP / SL / trailing / emergency
        PM->>Chain: reverse swap on exit trigger
    end
